# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system e230626fba103ae294848cab90774de5650147e06c5e76d02382ca0aeb453ad5
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 0ede15312aecad25bdacb252ccc6148d7b2e6011c4589eb5eba17a36c3f8a056
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm d66cd97104dee91876d87829812bf154945ea7acaf07b0055e36056caf888039
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 9f52ccac2f13106e64f8c60ecd79f9ae12ebca86c5c2b28c9e30ea40e81c01a8
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 5286bfc3743b0c2e56d8743f7b26481c70d45b44f7b6734a3c256e10d4a691a9
